					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Windows group policy:
1. Open the group policy editor tool with gpedit.msc 
2. Navigate to Policy Path: Computer Configuration\Administrative Templates\Google\Google Chrome\Extensions\
Policy Name: Configure extension installation allowlist
Policy State: Enabled
Policy Value: oiigbmnaadbkfbmpbfijlflahbdbdgdf

Note: oiigbmnaadbkfbmpbfijlflahbdbdgdfis the extension ID for scriptno (a commonly used Chrome extension), other extension IDs may vary.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
