   2. Navigate to Policy Path: Computer Configuration\Administrative Templates\Google\Google Chrome\Default search provider\
    Policy Name: Enable the default search provider
    Policy State: Enabled
    Policy Value: N/A

</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
