				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Controls the allowlist of URL patterns that autoplay will always be enabled on. If the "AutoplayAllowed" policy is set to "True" then this policy will have no effect. If the "AutoplayAllowed" policy is set to "False", then any URL patterns set in this policy will still be allowed to play.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
